# AI Agent Mandatory Rule

Before performing any action (reading, writing, modifying scripts, refactoring POM, running tests), you **MUST** read and strictly follow the guidelines defined in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Key requirements:
1. Always open your first response with the 3-line confirmation block defined in Section 0 of `AGENTS.md`.
2. Strictly enforce Clean Page Object Model: 100% locators and UI actions belong in Page Classes (e.g., `pages/` or `Keywords/pages/`). Never leave inline XPaths in test scripts.
3. Never fake PASS: assertions must verify actual DOM state after action.
4. Report your work using the 5-point report template in Section 6 of `AGENTS.md`.
